eturning appropriate error messages.\n  - AC-4.3: Tests co-located as `src/yaml-validator.test.ts` following project conventions.\n  - AC-4.4: All tests pass via `bun test`.\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n- **NFR-1**: Zero new dependencies — must not add entries to `dependencies` or `devDependencies` (except existing `@types/bun`).\n- **NFR-2**: Follows existing project patterns (camelCase functions, PascalCase types, kebab-case files, strict TypeScript).\n- **NFR-3**: Descriptive error messages for each validation failure.\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Full YAML spec compliance (anchors, tags, multi-document, complex types).\n- YAML-to-JSON conversion.\n- Streaming / large file support.\n"
